# Pollenreach Spit (CIPlay pollenreach_spit): the skiff beach at 1.2 m round 0 -26, the shelter at -9 -27, the mast
# locker at 7.5 -23.5, three pollen jars on the dunes, the leaflet board on the dune top at 2 14.
island Pollenreach Spit
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Pollen Trail
zone skiff
expect step 1
read Skiff log: following the pollen
expect step 2
open Skiff cabin
wait 3
expect step 3
use pollen1
use pollen2
use pollen3
expect story pollen 3
expect step 4
open Mast locker
wait 3
expect step 5
read Seedkeepers' leaflet
expect done
